  "limits": [
    "Fictional diagonal hydraulic layout on all four cars; lumped pressure and separated fluid supplies. No pedal-travel, fluid-boiling, master-cylinder, booster or ABS-valve faults. Existing shared pad/disc condition retained.",
    "Disc glow is temperature-driven emission, without additional lights. Closed dish rims occlude discs; remote cars do not receive detailed component temperatures.",
    "Actual public signaling/WebRTC tested between local browser processes/contexts. No separate physical-PC, mobile network, restrictive NAT or TURN traversal test.",
    "Software renderer, no subjective listening or physical controller test. CPU measurement excludes world/GPU/AI/audio and does not establish an FPS guarantee.",
    "Five offline flows plus full multiplayer use the exact final standalone bytes. The independent stall harness uses source modules and the shipped PeerJS library.",
    "Native stress fixture resets speed to 80 m/s before ten five-second braking intervals; this does not claim self-powered stock-car acceleration to that speed.",
    "Wheel bearings, steering components, other engine auxiliaries, weather, cockpit/driver, engine bay, further body parts, world/LOD/AI and spatial garage transitions remain incomplete in the full checklist.",
